  "query_preview": "..\n(Tonight through next Monday)\n\n8:00 PM Update. \n\nThe Heat Advisory which was in effect for portions of Northern \nNevada has expired. Temperatures have cooled significantly across \nmost of the region this evening, largely due to thunderstorm \nactivity. Storms did not reach Humboldt County this evening (where\ncurrent temperatures remain in the upper 80s to low 90s as of \n8PM), however temperatures there and across the region will \ncontinue to cool the rest of this evening and overnight. High \ntemperatures Tuesday will be 3 to 5 degrees cooler than the highs \nreached Monday. No changes to the forecast at this time.",
